   $q$What is the main function of sentence 4 in the report?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It explains why residents once hauled water from distant wells.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-paragraph-focus"},{"text":"It presents evidence that fog collectors produce large amounts of water.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"},{"text":"It defines a key term by describing what a fog collector is and how it is positioned.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It states the writer's opinion about the value of fog collectors.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"fact-read-as-opinion"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It defines a key term by describing what a fog collector is and how it is positioned.$q$, $q$Sentence 4 tells readers what a fog collector is, which they need before sentences 5 to 7 explain how it works. It gives no amounts, so it is not evidence of output.$q$, 'draft', 'c5fcfabc-5913-5c0a-96b0-998768ede1b4')
