  ('067f89a5-b03f-578f-9e3d-af4110814682', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g11-informative-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$The writer wants to add a quotation from Lucia Ferreyra after sentence 10. Which quotation best develops the point of that sentence?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"The second layer catches droplets that slip through the first, so far less fog passes through untouched,\" Ferreyra explained.","is_correct":true},{"text":"\"I have loved the ocean ever since I was a small child,\" Ferreyra said.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-quotation"},{"text":"\"Fog looks beautiful when the morning light shines through it,\" Ferreyra noted.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-focus-detail"},{"text":"\"The people of Punta Cardo should be proud of their village,\" Ferreyra said.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opinion-not-development"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"The second layer catches droplets that slip through the first, so far less fog passes through untouched," Ferreyra explained.$q$, $q$The correct quotation explains why the double layer in sentence 10 captures more water, so it develops the evidence. The quotation about pride is related to the village but does not explain the mesh finding.$q$, 'draft', 'c5fcfabc-5913-5c0a-96b0-998768ede1b4')
