  ('61e8a8de-8194-5710-b841-958fd9003861', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g11-narrative-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$What is the main purpose of sentences 5 through 7 in the narrative?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They establish the narrator's private problem so that the change in sentences 12 through 14 feels earned.","is_correct":true},{"text":"They describe the river setting and the weather on the morning of the race.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-setting-with-conflict"},{"text":"They show that the other rowers are angry with the narrator and plan a replacement.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"They explain the rules of rowing so that readers unfamiliar with the sport can follow the race.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mistakes-purpose-as-informative"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They establish the narrator's private problem so that the change in sentences 12 through 14 feels earned.$q$, $q$Sentences 5 through 7 set up the narrator's timing problem, which is solved when the narrator follows Marco and the boat stops wobbling. The text says "Nobody said anything," so there is no evidence the others are angry.$q$, 'draft', '2467747a-cf2a-53b6-97a6-bd364b396dca')
