   $q$What does the dialogue in sentence 9 add to the narrative?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It places the reader inside the race with urgent, clipped commands that show Priya's role as coxswain.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It provides background on how the team trained during the two weeks before the race.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-dialogue-purpose"},{"text":"It reveals that Priya doubts the narrator and wishes Danielle were rowing instead.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It resolves the main conflict by telling the narrator exactly how to fix the timing problem.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misplaces-resolution"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It places the reader inside the race with urgent, clipped commands that show Priya's role as coxswain.$q$, $q$The short shouted commands create urgency and show what a coxswain does. They do not fix the narrator's timing; the narrator finds that solution in sentence 12.$q$, 'draft', '2467747a-cf2a-53b6-97a6-bd364b396dca')
