   $q$The writer wants to develop the minor plot line about Danielle so it connects to the ending. Which sentence would best be added after sentence 15?$q$, $q$[{"text":"On the dock, Danielle was waving a wrapped wrist overhead, shouting my name louder than anyone.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Afterward I wondered whether Danielle would be upset that the boat had won without its usual seat three.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-tone"},{"text":"Danielle's wrist would heal in about three weeks, according to Danielle's doctor.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"fact-without-connection"},{"text":"Danielle had rowed in seat three for two full seasons and was one of the best rowers on the team.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"backstory-at-wrong-point"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$On the dock, Danielle was waving a wrapped wrist overhead, shouting my name louder than anyone.$q$, $q$Danielle cheering for the replacement ties that thread to the victory and adds warmth to the ending. The doctor's estimate mentions Danielle but does nothing to connect that thread to the race or its outcome.$q$, 'draft', '2467747a-cf2a-53b6-97a6-bd364b396dca')
