   $q$Which sentence interrupts the analysis and should be removed?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 4","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-analysis"},{"text":"Sentence 9","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-analysis"},{"text":"Sentence 6","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 8","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 8$q$, $q$Sentence 8 gives a general fact about ferries that says nothing about Marisol or the bell. Sentence 4 explains the slammed door comparison, which is the heart of the first paragraph's analysis.$q$, 'draft', '57329ddd-a95d-5346-b2ef-98b651da1a8b')
