   $q$How does sentence 7 help the writer's argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It proves that the partner system is the only reason Halvern's rowers come back.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"It shows that Abebe disagrees with Leaupepe about why rowers quit their clubs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It shows that Halvern's 81 percent return rate is unusually high, which is why the club's policies are worth explaining.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It explains how Halvern chooses which experienced rowers become partners.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows that Halvern's 81 percent return rate is unusually high, which is why the club's policies are worth explaining.$q$, $q$Comparing 81 percent with a regional average of 46 percent establishes that Halvern really is different, giving the research question its point. Sentence 7 says nothing about partners or about Abebe disagreeing with anyone.$q$, 'draft', 'fcd2195f-c892-56b6-86ef-ca3a8f145083')
