   $q$Which sentence would best fill the blank as the conclusion in sentence 11?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Taken together, these sources show that rowing is a difficult sport that takes a great deal of practice.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-conclusion"},{"text":"Taken together, these sources show that Leaupepe is an excellent coach whom every rower admires.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Taken together, the club report, the regional survey and the interviews suggest that partners and flexible schedules keep Halvern's rowers coming back.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Taken together, these sources prove that every rowing club should copy Halvern's policies starting next season.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Taken together, the club report, the regional survey and the interviews suggest that partners and flexible schedules keep Halvern's rowers coming back.$q$, $q$The choice naming partners and flexible schedules draws on all three sources and names the two policies that more than one source supports. Saying every club should copy Halvern goes beyond what a study of one club can show.$q$, 'draft', 'fcd2195f-c892-56b6-86ef-ca3a8f145083')
