   $q$Which sentence should be removed because it does not support the analysis of the poem?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 4","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-analysis"},{"text":"Sentence 3","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 6","is_correct":true},{"text":"Sentence 8","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 6$q$, $q$The temperature of kilns is a general fact, not evidence from the poem or analysis of it. Sentence 4 explains the effect of the refrain, so removing it would leave the quotation in sentence 3 unexplained.$q$, 'draft', '86a82509-8375-5c02-b9c8-606fc16ffac7')
