   $q$Which phrase best fills the blank at the start of sentence 7?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Because of the heat","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"Breaking this pattern","is_correct":true},{"text":"In the same way","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-similarity"},{"text":"For example","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-relationship"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Breaking this pattern$q$, $q$Sentence 3 sets up a refrain in the first three stanzas, and sentence 7 reports that the last stanza departs from it, so "Breaking this pattern" signals the change. "In the same way" wrongly suggests the final stanza continues the pattern.$q$, 'draft', '86a82509-8375-5c02-b9c8-606fc16ffac7')
