   $q$Why should the writer revise sentence (10)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It ends the essay by praising the alternative in informal language instead of restating why the darkroom should stay.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It is too long and should be split into two shorter sentences.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"surface-fix-only"},{"text":"It introduces an opposing claim that the essay never mentioned before.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-problem"},{"text":"It repeats the evidence from sentence (5) without adding anything.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-sentence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It ends the essay by praising the alternative in informal language instead of restating why the darkroom should stay.$q$, $q$A conclusion should follow from the argument, but sentence (10) drifts to praising digital photography in casual wording and never returns to the claim. The essay did mention the digital alternative in sentence (1), so the problem is not that the idea is new.$q$, 'draft', '242328e9-3dd5-568d-a0d2-763fe7f08981')
