   $q$Which sentence should the writer delete because it adds nothing to the argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (5)","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence (4)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-reasoning"},{"text":"sentence (7)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-concession"},{"text":"sentence (3)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (5)$q$, $q$Sentence (5) is an informal opinion that gives no reason or evidence for installing sensors. Sentence (4) should stay because it explains how the city would use the readings.$q$, 'draft', 'fd561ad4-6a2e-585c-b1ba-633844e72912')
